1..12
ok 1 list accepts a bare numeric st id (normalised), like intent wp
ok 2 at list and ac list render ids, paths, status
ok 3 green only from red; to-write to green is refused
ok 4 done aliases green and notdone aliases red
ok 5 ac status reports counts and gate verdict
ok 6 ac satisfy refuses test-backed ACs
ok 7 status edit is linter-stable
ok 8 ac satisfy writes a bare row instead of reporting a success it did not perform
ok 9 ac satisfy verifies the write landed rather than trusting sed's exit code
ok 10 an AT status carrying markdown emphasis is named, not silently read as not-green
ok 11 an out-of-vocabulary AT status is reported rather than ignored
ok 12 an unclosed non-test marker names the marker, not a missing test
